{"id":"junto","lemma":"junto","pos":"prep","rank":241,"glosses":["next to, together with, alongside","along with, together with, alongside","in conjunction with"],"ipa":"/ˈxunto/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-junto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él vive junto a mi casa.","en":"He lives next to me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/527130","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to applaud","l":"vivar"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"my"},{"g":"house"}]},{"text":"Siéntate junto a mí.","en":"Sit beside me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501141","words":[{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Camino junto a ella.","en":"I'm walking beside her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461733","words":[{"g":"way, route"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"she"}]},{"text":"Su casa está junto a un río.","en":"His house is by a river.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459201","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"river"}]},{"text":"Siempre pasamos nuestras vacaciones junto al mar.","en":"We always spend our vacation by the sea.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609792","words":[{"g":"always"},{"g":"to pass","l":"pasar"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"vacation, holiday","l":"vacación"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"sea"}]}]}